            Разобрать покупку в Крыму
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-krym-hero__trust" role="list">
          <div class="vn-krym-hero__trust-item" role="listitem">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
            <span>Офис в Крыму</span>
          </div>
          <div class="vn-krym-hero__trust-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="vn-krym-hero__trust-item" role="listitem">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"/><rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/></svg>
            <span>Дистанционный формат</span>
          </div>
          <div class="vn-krym-hero__trust-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="vn-krym-hero__trust-item" role="listitem">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
            <span>Весь полуостров</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-krym-hero__compact" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>Симферополь</span>
          <span class="vn-krym-hero__compact-dot"></span>
          <span>Ялта</span>
          <span class="vn-krym-hero__compact-dot"></span>
          <span>Побережье</span>
          <span class="vn-krym-hero__compact-dot"></span>
          <span>Весь Крым</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vn-krym-hero__right">
